Source: cix
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: maldous <matthew.aldous@gmail.com>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), cargo, rustc, cmake, g++, pkg-config, zlib1g-dev, libbz2-dev, liblzma-dev, libzstd-dev, libbrotli-dev, liblz4-dev, libsnappy-dev
Standards-Version: 4.7.0
Rules-Requires-Root: no

Package: cix
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: lossless command-line compressor
 CIX creates and restores lossless, self-describing CIX archives.
 .
 This package installs one native executable and its cix, uncix, and cixcat
 command aliases. Optional host adapters and full-engine bridge providers are
 not implied by this base package.

Package: cix-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Depends: cix (= ${binary:Version}), ${misc:Depends}
Description: native CIX development headers and libraries
 CIX headers, shared and static native libraries, CMake package metadata,
 pkg-config metadata, and a small C embedding example.
 .
 This development package exposes the process-free native SDK. It does not
 provide an unqualified external-host adapter or a full-engine bridge bundle.
